        <p class="mb-6">
          A low-protein diet is a powerful medical therapy, not a do-it-yourself internet weight loss hack. Healthy individuals with normal kidney and liver function should <strong>not</strong> adopt a low-protein diet, as it offers no athletic or aesthetic advantage.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-6">
