          <li><strong>Serum Potassium and Phosphorus:</strong> to ensure your fruit and vegetable intake does not trigger hyperkalemia or bone mineral disease.</li>
          <li><strong>Bicarbonate Levels:</strong> to ensure metabolic acidosis remains well-managed.</li>
        </ul>
